Z||000002||Songman||06-19-2001||06:49 PM||||And here's another...<BR> <A HREF="http://fiero2m4.homestead.com/RPOlist.html" TARGET=_blank>http://fiero2m4.homestead.com/RPOlist.html</A> <P>Jim, the Indy's could be optioned just like any other car except that they all had a few things that were standard on them. These included: sunroof, carpeted floor mats, electric side mirrors, rear spoiler, leather 3-spoke steering wheel, AM/FM Cassette Stereo with clock, luggage carrier delete. All Indys had this is as a minimum, and obviously the special coloring inside and out. <P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/songman_1.gif"> <BR><A HREF="http://members.home.com/tnfieros" TARGET=_blank>Tennessee Fiero Owners</A>||||reg||1
